; Random layouts of every container kind, with locked, placed and
; other-view parts, side parts, popups and prompts anywhere, and random
; operations on them; after each, what layout holds is checked against a
; model of the rules. Each result says whether many checks ran, and how
; many failed. recent-views' timer would make a run depend on timing.
> (set-option! recent-views:delay 1000)
> (let ([r (focus-checks:run client 1 200 30)]) (list (> (car r) 10000) (cadr r)))
(#t 0)
> (let ([r (focus-checks:run client 2 200 30)]) (list (> (car r) 10000) (cadr r)))
(#t 0)
> (let ([r (focus-checks:run client 3 200 30)]) (list (> (car r) 10000) (cadr r)))
(#t 0)
